    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96709" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλίτ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλιτ-ῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>like a</i>
			
